  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/mono-no-aware> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A classical Japanese ideal of feeling deeply moved by things because they pass: an empathetic, often bittersweet sensitivity to the fleeting beauty of nature and human life, which the scholar Motoori Norinaga made the central concept of Japanese literature." .
