  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Resilience" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "bouncing back" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "psychological resilience" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "resilience after adversity" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "resilient trajectory" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/coping> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Keeping a fairly stable, healthy level of functioning through and after a loss, trauma or other major stressor, rather than breaking down and later recovering. Researchers treat it mainly as an outcome that many people show, not a fixed trait that a few people have; how common it is depends on how it is measured." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/adversity-and-mortality> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Resilience" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/dichotomy-of-control> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/equanimity> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/grief-and-loss> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/post-traumatic-growth> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resilience> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/three-dimensional-wisdom-model> .
