  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/golden-rule> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/golden-rule/s5> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/golden-rule> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/golden-rule/s6> .
