  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/acceptance> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#appliedIn> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/adversity> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/acceptance> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#confusedWith> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/resignation> .
