  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/dichotomy-of-control> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/dichotomy-of-control/s3> .
