<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I hiding this feeling because the moment calls for it, or because I always hide feelings like this?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has the feeling actually changed, or only my face?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there someone I could tell how this really landed, and have I told them?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Could I look at the situation differently, rather than just clamping down on my reaction to it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/example> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Rewrite> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#after> "Stay composed in the room, since this isn't the moment, but name it briefly: 'I see it differently; can we go through the data after?' Later, ask what the criticism might be getting right, and talk it over with a trusted peer." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#before> "Keep a blank face, say 'fine', move on, and never mention it to anyone. Feelings have no place at work." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#situation> "In a project review, a senior colleague dismisses your team's proposal in front of everyone. You feel a hot rush of anger and embarrassment." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#why> "Holding back a display for a few minutes can fit the setting; making a rule of never showing or sharing the feeling leaves it running underneath, blurs what you take in, and keeps others from knowing where you stand." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Obstacle> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Emotional suppression" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/emotional-suppression> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "bottling up emotions" .
