  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/view-from-above/s5> <https://schema.org/url> <https://read.qxmd.com/read/28857578/awe-and-humility> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/view-from-above/s6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
