  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I treating how much I know about this as if it were the same as knowing what to do?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What in this situation am I unsure of, and have I admitted it to myself and to others?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wisdom/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Would this choice still look good to me if I judged it by the kind of life I want to live, not only by today's goal?" .
