  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Source> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#sourceType> "scholarly-encyclopedia" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s3> <https://schema.org/url> <https://plato.stanford.edu/ENTRiES/aristotle-ethics/> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Judgment and Decision Making, 10(1), 1–17 (Nieuwenstein, Wierenga, Morey, Wicherts, Blom, Wagenmakers & van Rijn, 2015)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "On making the right choice: A meta-analysis and large-scale replication attempt of the unconscious thought advantage" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Source> .
