  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 60(2), 181–192 (Wilson & Schooler, 1991; record on Jonathan Schooler's UCSB lab site)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Thinking too much: Introspection can reduce the quality of preferences and decisions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Source> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#sourceType> "peer-reviewed" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s5> <https://schema.org/url> <https://labs.psych.ucsb.edu/schooler/jonathan/node/404> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/deliberation/s6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "American Psychologist, 64(6), 515–526 (Kahneman & Klein, 2009; doi:10.1037/a0016755; PubMed record)" .
