  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/imaginary-future-generations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/seeking-counsel> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/imaginary-future-generations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/imaginary-future-generations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/stewardship> .
