<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I named the exact moment when I will act, or only the goal I hope to reach?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What is the cue that usually pulls me off course, and do I have a then-response ready for it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Do I still endorse this goal, or am I making plans to avoid admitting I no longer want it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "If I am about to drop the plan, has something genuinely changed, or has the moment of keeping it simply arrived?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/example> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Rewrite> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#after> "\"If I notice I'm about to speak while someone else is mid-sentence, then I'll write my point down and wait for them to finish.\" In the meeting, the urge to cut in becomes her cue to reach for the notepad." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#before> "\"I'll just try harder to listen next week.\" In the next tense meeting the resolution is forgotten within minutes, and she cuts in twice." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#situation> "A team lead has decided, for good reasons, to stop interrupting colleagues in meetings, but keeps doing it when a discussion gets heated." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#why> "A general resolution relies on remembering and summoning willpower at exactly the moment emotion is highest. An if-then plan decides in calm advance what the trigger is and what to do, so the situation itself prompts the wiser response." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/1> <https://schema.org/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/1> <https://schema.org/text> "Check that the goal is one you have actually decided on and still endorse; if you are lukewarm about it, deliberate first, because a plan cannot supply commitment you do not have." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/2> <https://schema.org/position> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/2> <https://schema.org/text> "Identify the critical moment, either the opportunity to act (a time, a place, a recurring event) or the obstacle that usually derails you (a temptation, a distraction, a feeling)." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/3> <https://schema.org/position> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/3> <https://schema.org/text> "Write one plan per cue in the form \"If [specific situation], then I will [specific action]\", making the cue concrete enough that you will recognise it and the action small enough to start at once." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/4> <https://schema.org/position> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/4> <https://schema.org/text> "For your usual obstacle, add a shielding plan, such as \"If I feel the urge to check messages, then I will note it and keep writing until the timer ends.\"" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/5> <https://schema.org/position> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/5> <https://schema.org/text> "Say or rehearse the plan a few times so the cue and the response are firmly linked, and remove anything in the setting that competes with it." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/6> <https://schema.org/position> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/6> <https://schema.org/text> "Afterwards, review whether the cue appeared and the plan fired; revise the plan if circumstances have genuinely changed, not merely because keeping it felt hard." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowTo> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <https://schema.org/name> "Implementation intentions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/4> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/5> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/howto/6> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Practice> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Implementation intentions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "if-then planning" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "if-then plans" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "planning prompts" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "when-then plans" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-regulation-strategies> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Turning a decision you have already made into a specific if-then plan that names the situation in which you will act and exactly what you will do (\"If it is 9 a.m. at my desk, then I open the report before the inbox\"), so that the moment itself, rather than fresh willpower, triggers the better choice." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/judgment-and-decisions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Implementation intentions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/after-action-review> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/evening-review> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/weakness-of-will> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/implementation-intentions/s1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/implementation-intentions/s2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/implementation-intentions/s3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/implementation-intentions/s4> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/implementation-intentions/s5> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/implementation-intentions/s6> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#addresses> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/procrastination> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#addresses> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/weakness-of-will> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#complements> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/mental-contrasting> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#demonstratedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/flu-vaccination-planning-prompts-study> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#demonstratedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions-meta-analysis> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#develops> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-control> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#domain> "judgment-and-decisions" .
