  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions/example> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implementation-intentions> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#explainedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/strategic-automaticity> .
