  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/ikigai/s6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Source> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/ikigai/s6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#sourceType> "practitioner-journal" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/ikigai/s6> <https://schema.org/url> <https://www.mappmagazine.com/articles/a-life-worth-experiencing> .
