<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What do I not know about this situation, and how might the facts change what I think?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Whose perspective have I not yet considered, and what would this look like from where they stand?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there a way forward that serves both my interests and theirs, rather than one at the other's expense?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I aiming at what is true and fair here, or only at winning the point?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model> .
