  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/common-wisdom-model> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A 2020 consensus framework from an international task force of wisdom scientists that defines wisdom as metacognition applied to reasoning and problem-solving and grounded in morality: perspectival metacognition (knowing the limits of one's knowledge, weighing several viewpoints, adapting to context) joined to moral aspirations (pursuit of truth, prosocial goals, a sense of shared humanity)." .
