  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/teaching-for-wisdom/s6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Source> .
