  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/teaching-for-wisdom> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/teaching-for-wisdom/s7> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/teaching-for-wisdom> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/teaching-for-wisdom/s8> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/teaching-for-wisdom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#addresses> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/folly> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/teaching-for-wisdom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#develops> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wise-reasoning> .
