  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/evening-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "evening self-examination" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/evening-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "nightly review" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/evening-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/reflective-practices> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/evening-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A brief, regular look back at the day before sleep, asking what you did well, where you fell short of your own standards and what you will do differently tomorrow; taught in Pythagorean, Stoic and Confucian sources and aimed at steady improvement rather than self-punishment." .
