  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/honesty> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/intellectual-courage> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/honesty> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/intellectual-humility> .
