  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/after-action-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "debriefing after action" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/after-action-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "structured debrief" .
