  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/after-action-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A short, structured, non-punitive conversation held soon after a task or event, in which the people who did the work establish what was supposed to happen, what actually happened, why, and what they will keep or change next time, so that experience turns into judgment instead of blame or forgetting." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/after-action-review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/wisdom-at-work> .
