  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/leading-others> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wise-leadership> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/leading-others> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/leading-others/s1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/leading-others> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/leading-others/s2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/leading-others> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/leading-others/s3> .
