  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/stewardship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/courage> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/stewardship> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/hubris> .
